@1 = ~How did you get here?~
@2 = ~With the key.~
@3 = ~The key? Hold on... You've defeated the Lord of the Undead!~
@4 = ~Indeed, does that create a problem for you?~
@5 = ~Are you really joking about this... Hmph! Revenge will have to wait, my master must be informed of this unfortunate turn of events.~
